1. PURPOSE
============================================================

The CodePilot Free Use License (CFUL) governs the use, copying,
modification, merging, private sharing, and other permitted activities
involving CodePilot software.

CodePilot is intended to remain free to obtain and use. This license
allows users to use, copy, modify, merge, and privately share the Software
for permitted purposes while restricting unauthorized public publication,
public redistribution, and sale of copies.

This license also establishes separate protections for official CodePilot
logos, wordmarks, icons, and designated branding assets.

By exercising permissions granted under this license, you agree to comply
with its applicable terms and restrictions.

============================================================
2. DEFINITIONS
============================================================

"CodePilot" means the CodePilot Unity Development Assistant software and
other materials expressly identified as being governed by this license.

"Software" means the source code and other software components covered
by this license.

"Rights Holder" means the person or legal entity that owns or is
authorized to exercise the applicable rights in the relevant material.

"CodePilot Branding" means official CodePilot logos, wordmarks, icons,
branding images, and other designated visual identity assets owned by
or legally controlled by the applicable rights holder.

"Private Sharing" means providing a copy of the Software directly to
friends or other individual recipients without charging a fee and without
making the copy publicly available.

"Public Redistribution" means publishing, uploading, releasing, or
otherwise making copies of the Software available to the general public
through public repositories, websites, download platforms, file-hosting
services, or other public distribution channels.

"Modified Version" means a version of the Software that has been changed,
adapted, extended, or combined with other code.

"Official Repository" means the CodePilot repository maintained at:
https://github.com/TXSRP/CodePilot/tree/main

============================================================
3. PERMITTED USE
============================================================

Subject to this license, you are permitted to:

a. Use CodePilot free of charge.

b. Make copies of CodePilot for your own use.

c. Modify the Software for your own use.

d. Merge the Software with other code for your own use.

e. Use CodePilot for personal, educational, research, and commercial
development activities.

f. Retain the original CodePilot Branding when using a permitted copy
of the complete Software package.

g. Share copies of CodePilot privately with friends or other individual
recipients, provided that the copies are shared free of charge and are
not made publicly available.

h. Share the official CodePilot repository link and authorized official
download links with other people.

i. Submit pull requests to the Official Repository, including bug fixes,
improvements, code changes, documentation, and other contributions.

j. Maintain private copies, private forks, backups, and Modified Versions
for your own permitted use.

These permissions do not grant ownership of CodePilot or its Branding.

Permission to use, copy, modify, merge, or privately share the Software
does not grant permission to publicly redistribute copies.

============================================================
4. RESTRICTIONS ON PUBLICATION AND REDISTRIBUTION
============================================================

Unless the Rights Holder grants prior written permission, you may NOT:

a. Publish or publicly redistribute copies of CodePilot.

b. Upload copies of CodePilot to public repositories, download websites,
file-hosting services, or other public distribution platforms.

c. Sell, rent, sublicense, or charge a fee specifically for copies of
CodePilot or Modified Versions.

d. Publish or publicly redistribute Modified Versions of CodePilot.

e. Repackage CodePilot and present it as your own software product.

f. Claim to be the original creator, owner, or official maintainer of
CodePilot without authorization.

g. Create unauthorized public mirrors, download pages, or public releases
containing copies of CodePilot.

h. Circumvent these restrictions by using another person, account, or
organization to perform an activity prohibited by this license.

i. Charge another person specifically for providing a copy of CodePilot,
including by disguising the charge as a packaging, access, or distribution
fee.

These restrictions do NOT prohibit the private sharing expressly allowed
under Section 3.

Sharing a copy directly with a friend for free is permitted. Uploading that
copy to a public website or repository for anyone to download is not
permitted without prior written permission.

Sharing an official CodePilot repository link or authorized download link
is permitted and is not considered unauthorized Public Redistribution.

Any redistribution authorized by the Rights Holder must comply with the
conditions of that authorization.

